Fresh graduate or final year university students in major: Human Resources, Communications, Marketing, or related majors are preferred;
Commit to 3-6 months internship;
Ability to create content;
English require TOEIC 500+ or equivalent.
Familiar with Microsoft Offices and Google Workspace;
Can-do attitude, eyes for detail and improvement mindset.

Nice-to-have (great advantage):

Experience in recruitment sourcing and employer branding;
Familiar with design web applications, such as Canva;
Content writing skills in both Vietnamese and English.

